摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Enterprise-grade, local-first Agent Workbench for people and agent teams. A unified multi-engine workspace for Codex Harness, DeepSeek Harness, and OpenCode, with unified plugins and Skills, multi-agent projects and tasks, and editable code, documents, presentations, design, and ","id":"gh:1044010907","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"iPolloWork","slug":"Devin-AXIS/iPolloWork","topics":["agent-collaboration","agent-skills","ai-agents","ai-work","claude-code","codex","codex-plugin","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","enterprise-agent-workspace","hermes-agent","ipollowork-plugin","ipollowork-skill","multi-agent-workspace","opencode","opencode-plugin","self-evolving-ai","visual-editor"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Enterprise-grade, local-first Agent Workbench for people and agent teams. A unified multi-engine wor"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"kspace for Codex Harness, DeepSeek Harness, and OpenCode, with unified plugins and Skills, multi-age"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"nt projects and tasks, and editable code, documents, presentations, design, and "},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# iPolloWork"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**The enterprise-grade, local-first Agent Workbench for people and agent teams—one workspace for mul"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"tiple agent engines, one unified system for plugins and Skills, multi-agent projects and tasks, and "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"editable creation across code, documents, presentations, websites, design, and video.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/201b561a-22ec-4c8e-a4e8-f34172cf0aa3"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"iPolloWork is the unified workspace layer for the next agent-native way of working. It does not spli"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"t projects or extensions by runtime: teams coordinate agents, tasks, schedules, plugins, Skills, too"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ls, execution, and editable outputs from one control surface. Describe the outcome; agents plan and "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"execute; your team reviews progress, approves actions, and keeps editing the result in the same plac"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ecute; your team reviews progress, approves actions, and keeps editing the result in the same place."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"iPolloWork is not positioned as a replacement for a single coding agent. It connects Codex, DeepSeek"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" Harness, OpenCode, and future agent runtimes through explicit compatibility boundaries while preser"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ving the native strengths of each ecosystem. Coding is only the starting point: when the output is a"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" deck, web page, visual design, or video, it remains editable instead of becoming a finished file or"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"sual design, or video, it remains editable instead of becoming a finished file or a chat transcript."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Join the official iPolloWork WeChat community\nScan with WeChat to join the official group for produc"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"t updates and community discussions."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What makes it different"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **One workbench across agent engines** — use Codex, DeepSeek Harness, OpenCode, and future runtime"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"s without rebuilding the project experience around each engine.\n- **One global extension system** — "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"install, enable, update, and uninstall portable plugins, Skills, agents, commands, services, and aut"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"horization once; optional engine-native bindings stay behind the same lifecycle.\n- **Project-native "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"human-agent collaboration** — give people and agents one shared project view for responsibilities, t"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"asks, schedules, execution health, and results instead of scattering work across isolated chats.\n- *"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"*One editable production loop** — move from code to documents, websites, presentations, design, and "},{"id":"p10s8","text":"video while keeping text, images, layouts, timelines, and scenes editable after generation.\n- **Loca"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"l and enterprise control** — run locally, bring your own model or provider, review permissions and e"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"xecution, and connect organization services only when a team needs them."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Agent runtime compatibility"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"OpenCode is the default local execution runtime today. Codex and DeepSeek Harness (DSH) are optional"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" peer runtimes with native session and tool adapters. The `ipollowork-ui-mcp` control surface also l"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ets external clients operate the desktop. These paths share the workbench while preserving each runt"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s operate the desktop. These paths share the workbench while preserving each runtime's capabilities."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The collaboration model keeps iPolloWork as the project workspace: a task can delegate bounded work "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"to DSH subagents when useful, then bring structured progress and results back into the same project."},{"id":"p13s3","text":" Each runtime retains its own agents, Skills, plugins, and execution model."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Run iPolloWork creative plugins directly in DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness users can install iPolloWork's native Design, PPT, and Video views into the DSH Web"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" UI and start them from any project directory:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080, start a conversation, and choose **Design**, **PPT**, or **Video**. If t"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"he `dsh` command is already installed, replace `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh` with `dsh`. DeepSeek Harness i"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"s currently a developer preview, so plugin compatibility follows its active release line."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Requirements for source development and packaging"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Git\n- Node.js 22 or newer\n- pnpm 11, enabled through Corepack with `corepack enable`\n- Bun 1.3.10 "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"or newer, used to build the local Orchestrator sidecar\n- macOS: Xcode Command Line Tools (`xcode-sel"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ect --install`)\n- Windows: Visual Studio 2022 Build Tools with **Desktop development with C++** and "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"the Windows SDK; use PowerShell or Command Prompt\n- Linux: a standard Electron build environment wit"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"h a C/C++ toolchain, Python 3, `pkg-config`, and the desktop libraries required by Electron; the rel"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"ease build uses Ubuntu 22.04"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"OpenCode is downloaded and prepared as a separate sidecar during the first desktop build. iPolloWork"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" does not fork or rewrite OpenCode, and OpenCode can continue to be upgraded independently."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Architecture boundary"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Agent execution, task state, and streaming are normalized at the shared engine boundary while engi"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ne-native behavior remains inside its adapter.\n- Portable Skills, plugins, MCP servers, and project "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"capabilities use one lifecycle; engine-specific enhancements stay optional.\n- Each conversation sele"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"cts its execution engine and optional work template. Projects supply shared goals and resources. Tem"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"plates provide examples, Skills and result criteria; each engine owns planning, subagents, coordinat"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"ion, checks and final results.\n- Existing template role prompts and Skill references are projected i"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"nto namespaced native OpenCode subagents and Codex role configuration. Built-in workers remain avail"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"able; templates do not require a fixed worker count or execution order. Conversation-specific role e"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"dits remain scoped task guidance.\n- iPolloWork displays native execution and scoped artifacts. It do"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"es not add hidden repair prompts, restart native agent work, or run a second delivery workflow in th"},{"id":"p23s11","text":"e client. Existing media and render tools remain available to the engine.\n- iPolloCloud handles iden"},{"id":"p23s12","text":"tity, organizations, entitlements, hosted worker lifecycle, administration, and commercial Apps.\n- T"},{"id":"p23s13","text":"he Cloud connection is optional. Local iPolloWork works without an account or commercial service.\n- "},{"id":"p23s14","text":"OpenCode and DeepSeek Harness remain independent components and can continue to evolve without turni"},{"id":"p23s15","text":"ng iPolloWork into a fork of either runtime."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
